    "UIName": "Koshi",
    "Id": "chassisdef_koshi_KS-1",
    "Name": "Koshi",
    "Details": "Inspired by the success of the Clan Hell's Horses' Black Hawk design, Clan Diamond Shark developed what is in essence a simplified, non-Omni version of the older Mist Lynx OmniMech. Primarily for sale to Inner Sphere customers, the Hell's Horses marketing ploy of adopting a familiar designation the 'Mech was dubbed the Koshi, a decision that did not sit well with many of the more conservative members of the Clan.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Narrow/Low Profile</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 0.98</color></b>",
